## Tips {% #tips %}

{% aside type="caution" id="storms-aqua-keep" %}
The shop spends aquamarine as soon as the store is nearly full. Set **Aquamarine to keep** first if you save aquamarine for something else.
{% /aside %}

- Turn on **Mead replace** and **Send food** whenever troops stay in the Storm Islands castle.
- Hard fortresses are off by default. Turn them on one level at a time and watch the log.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [TOO_MANY_ATTACK_PLUGINS](/errors/#too-many-attack-plugins): more attack plugins are on than your cap allows, so the bot does not start.
- [PLUGIN_ATTACK_CAP](/errors/#plugin-attack-cap): the settings do not save because too many attack plugins are on.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ARMY](/errors/#plugin-option-army): the army setting can't be read.
